  "description": "Wild Prairie Fur Con (WPFCon) was a furry convention in Winnipeg, Manitoba, conceived by Wild Prairie Furs, a group of furries in the Manitoba area, and organized by Oddball Organizers. It was first held August 11 to 12, 2018, and held each August except in 2020 and 2021 because of the COVID-19 pandemic. Attendance grew from 181 to 326, and the convention supported Winnipeg animal charities. It announced its closure in December 2023.",
